WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.661
The Barbary pirates did not seem so scary anymore.

2
00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:07.811
Some of them started to swim back to the island.

3
00:00:07.812 --> 00:00:10.511
Others tried to get on their ship.

4
00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:14.886
But of course the animals would not let them.

5
00:00:14.887 --> 00:00:16.957
Then things got worse.

6
00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:21.027
Dr. Dolittle could see sharks swimming toward the pirates.

7
00:00:21.028 --> 00:00:23.257
The pirates saw them too.

8
00:00:23.258 --> 00:00:27.732
"SHARKS! SHARKS!" they screamed.

9
00:00:27.733 --> 00:00:33.719
Ben Ali, the Barbary Dragon, looked more like the Barbary Frog!

10
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.531
The sharks quickly made a circle around the pirates.

11
00:00:37.532 --> 00:00:41.201
One great shark swam over to Dr. Dolittle.

12
00:00:41.202 --> 00:00:44.747
"Are you Dr. Dolittle?" the shark asked.

13
00:00:44.748 --> 00:00:47.395
"Yes," the doctor replied.

14
00:00:47.396 --> 00:00:52.989
"Oh, I’m so pleased to meet you," the shark said blushing.

15
00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.231
The pirates watched the doctor.

16
00:00:55.232 --> 00:00:58.129
"What is he doing?" panted one pirate.

17
00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:02.170
"It looks like he’s talking to the shark!" answered another.

18
00:01:02.171 --> 00:01:06.924
"That’s impossible!" the first pirate gasped.

19
00:01:06.925 --> 00:01:08.514
"These men are bad.

20
00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:12.157
Especially Ben Ali," said the shark.

21
00:01:12.158 --> 00:01:15.384
"If you want we will eat them up for you."

22
00:01:15.385 --> 00:01:20.046
"Thank you. But that’s okay," Dr. Dolittle replied.

23
00:01:20.047 --> 00:01:24.368
"Could you bring Ben Ali over here, please?"

24
00:01:24.369 --> 00:01:27.232
The shark swam over to Ben Ali.

25
00:01:27.233 --> 00:01:33.218
"No! Go away! Mommy!" cried the Barbary Dragon.

26
00:01:33.219 --> 00:01:37.134
The shark chased Ben Ali over to Dr. Dolittle.

27
00:01:37.135 --> 00:01:42.063
Dr. Dolittle leaned over the side and spoke to the pirate.

28
00:01:42.064 --> 00:01:47.891
"Ben Ali! You have been a very bad man!" scolded the doctor.

29
00:01:47.892 --> 00:01:52.969
"But if you promise to do as I tell you, these sharks will not eat you."

30
00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:58.360
Of course the pirate did not want to become the sharks’ dinner.

31
00:01:58.361 --> 00:02:03.687
"What is it? I promise!" begged the pirate captain.

32
00:02:03.688 --> 00:02:06.517
Dr. Dolittle pointed to the island.

33
00:02:06.518 --> 00:02:10.069
"You and your men must go to that island."

34
00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:11.775
"And do what?

35
00:02:11.776 --> 00:02:15.983
There's nothing to do there!" complained Ben Ali.

36
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:19.727
"You will become farmers," the doctor told him.

37
00:02:19.728 --> 00:02:22.026
"Thunder and lightning! Never!

38
00:02:22.027 --> 00:02:28.691
I am a pirate!" shouted Ben Ali.

39
00:02:28.692 --> 00:02:32.470
"Please, let me be a pirate," he begged.

40
00:02:32.471 --> 00:02:40.330
But Dr. Dolittle said firmly, "No! You must promise to be a farmer and never leave the island.

41
00:02:40.331 --> 00:02:48.521
If you don’t keep your promise," he warned, "these sharks will eat you up."

42
00:02:48.522 --> 00:02:52.275
Ben Ali, the Barbary Dragon, had no choice.

43
00:02:52.276 --> 00:02:56.309
"Okay, I’ll be a farmer," he said.

44
00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:58.723
Dr. Dolittle called the shark.

45
00:02:58.724 --> 00:03:02.651
"Make sure the pirates never leave the island."

46
00:03:02.652 --> 00:03:07.723
"What are those strange sounds you’re making?" Ben Ali asked.

47
00:03:07.724 --> 00:03:13.290
But before Dr. Dolittle could answer, the sharks took the pirates away.

48
00:03:13.291 --> 00:03:17.429
Dr. Dolittle and the animals watched them swim to the island.

49
00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:22.225
"That’s the end of the Barbary Dragon," chuckled Too-Too.

50
00:03:22.226 --> 00:03:27.436
"And the beginning of the Barbary Farmer," laughed Gub-Gub.

51
00:03:27.437 --> 00:03:34.086
"He didn’t seem too scary, did he?" giggled the pushmi-pullyu.

52
00:03:34.087 --> 00:03:37.792
Dr. Dolittle set off again for their journey home.

53
00:03:37.793 --> 00:03:42.359
"Dab-Dab, I hope you learned your lesson," the doctor said.

54
00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.686
"Yes, I did.

55
00:03:43.687 --> 00:03:49.273
From now on, I will believe what the rats say," Dab-Dab replied.

56
00:03:49.274 --> 00:03:55.165
Dr. Dolittle was happy to hear that.

